  "instructions": [
    "Heat butter in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat. Add beef and cook until browned, about 5 minutes. Add onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes. Add garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add flour and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add broth and bring to a boil, scraping up browned bits. Add carrots and potatoes and return to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes. Stir in red pepper paste and season with black pepper.",
    "Stir in parsley and serve hot."
